VALUES (
    '25522072', '10374847', 'POST ERCP pancreatitis', 'PANCREATITIS',
    'A patient was admitted via ew emer. for evaluation of abdominal symptoms, later diagnosed with acute pancreatitis.', '___ yo man with pancreatic head Ca s/p plastic stent 2mos ago,  now s/p ERCP with metal stent placement ___ and EUS/FNA of LN  near GDA presents with right flank pain which started last  evening. Pain is constant, dull in right flank radiating to  right abdomen, ___ last night, now ___. No N/V. Tolerated  breakfast. No F/C/S.   In ED, abdominal CT showed no free air, and new inflammatory  changes around the metal stent in the porta hepatis. Labs  remarkable for elevated lipase (1219).  ROS as above. All other systems negative.', 'Pancreatic CA - s/p plastic, and now metal stent. Is awaiting  possible resection pending results of para-GDA LN done ___.  Also has R portacath for possible chemo  A.Fib, on coumadin Colon CA, s/p resection in ___ DM II - on insulin S/P portacath right chest - not accessed yet Chronic L>R ___ edema, on lasix  ALLERGIES: PCN (rash), ASA (GI bleed)      Social History: ___ Family History: No CA in family.', '[VITALS] Temp: NA BP: NA HR: 99 O2Sat: NA Weight: NA  [EXAM] Afebrile VSS Moderately obese, pleasant gentleman in NAD A&Ox3 Lungs - CTAB Chest - well-healing right upper chest portacath incision, no  tenderness, swelling or erythema over device CV- RRR, no m/r/g Abd-soft,obese, nontender Back - no CVAT Extr - trace RLE and 1+ LLE edema, no calf tenderness Neuro - strength, sensation normal in all 4 extr',
    'active', 'system_generator'
);


