l 1500ml, Urine Amt 1500ml  HEENT: Right eye subconjunctival hemorrhage  Gen: NAD, AxOx3 Card: RRR, no m/r/g Pulm: CTAB, no respiratory distress Abd: Soft, mild-tender, non-distended, normal bs.   Wounds: c/d/i Ext: No edema, warm well-perfused',
