VALUES (
    '21782521', '10472364', 'Appendicitis', 'APPENDICITIS',
    'A patient was admitted via ew emer. for evaluation of abdominal symptoms, later diagnosed with acute appendicitis.', '___ with Marphan''s was well until 6 days prior when he began to experience vague abdominal pain. The pain progressed over the subsequent 24h, peaking on ___ night in severe intensity after which point the pt began to feel better but failed to continue improving over the past ___ days with persistent, dull, lower abdominal discomfort. He has been tolerating PO albeit with a decreased appetite. He has been constipated taking MiraLax with good effect. No nausea or vomiting, + subjective fevers and chills. ROS otherwise  negative.', '___''s HTN   Social History: ___ Family History: noncontributory', '[VITALS] Temp: NA BP: 129/69 HR: NA O2Sat: 98 Weight: NA  [EXAM] Pain 98.2 97.5 61 129/69 18 94RA  Gen: Well, NAD, A&Ox3 CV: RRR, No R/G/M RESP: CTAB ABD: Soft, Non-distended, minimal RLQ tenderness to deep palpation. No rebound, No guarding',
    'active', 'system_generator'
);


