    'A patient was admitted via ew emer. for evaluation of abdominal symptoms, later diagnosed with acute pancreatitis.', 'Patient is a ___ female with c/o nausea, vomiting, and  epigastric abdominal pain since last night (___).  Pain  midline, radiation bilaterally in band-like fashion.  Unable to  tolerate POs.  Ate chicken and rice for lunch yesterday and then ice cream for dinner.  Pain started after that. Endorses chills overnight but no fevers.  Also with diarrhea overnight.  No dysuria, no headache. Patient was  transferred from OSH for evaluation.', 'Rheumatoid Arthritis x ___ Depression   Steroid-induced hypertension   Hyperhydrosis Hyperalgias ___ chronic narcotic use Anxiety Borderline personality disorder   PSH: hemorrhoidectomy (___), triple fusion of the right ankle  in ___, unknown GYN surgery, hemorrhoidectomy ___ (___)    Social History: ___ Family History: No family history of autoimmun disorders', '[VITALS] Temp: NA BP: NA HR: 120 O2Sat: NA Weight: NA  [EXAM] Gen: AOx3, NAD Neuro: Pain well controlled Lungs: CTAB Heart: RRR, no m/r/g Abd: Non-distended, soft, tender to epigastric and RUQ  palpation; no gaurding or rebound. 1+ Bowel sounds. Ext: DP and ___ pulses 2+, no c/c/e',
    'active', 'system_generator'
