om pancreatic cancer at age ___.  Her  father has HTN. Her maternal aunt has breast cancer.', '[VITALS] Temp: 98.0 BP: 124/73 HR: NA O2Sat: 98 Weight: NA  [EXAM] Vitals:  T 98.0  P 71 BP 124/73 RR 18  SaO2 100% on RA GEN: NAD, comfortable appearing   HEENT: ncat.? injected sclerae  MMM   NECK:  supple CV: s1s2 rrr soft SEM at ___ can be heard in axilla but not  holosystolic  RESP: b/l ae no w/c/r   ABD: +bs, soft, NT even with deep palpation in all quadrants,  ND, no guarding or rebound.    EXTR:no c/c/e 2+pulses   DERM: no rash   NEURO: face symmetric speech fluent   PSYCH: calm, cooperative    Exam',
