154/92 HR: NA O2Sat: 98 Weight: NA  [EXAM] ADMISSION EXAM -------------- Vital Signs: 98.0  154/92  65  18  100% on RA glucose:  .  GEN: NAD, well-appearing, lying in bed, obese EYES: PERRL, EOMI, conjunctiva clear, anicteric ENT: moist mucous membranes, no exudates  NECK: supple  CV: RRR s1s2 nl, no m/r/g PULM: CTA, no r/r/w  GI: normal BS, tender in RUQ, neg ___, no r/g, no HSM   EXT: warm, no c/c/e SKIN: no rashes  NEURO: alert, oriented x 3, answers ? appropriately, follows  commands, non focal PSYCH: appropriate ACCESS: PIV FOLEY: absent',
    'active', 'system_generator'
