ess on deep palpation to RUQ. Otherwise soft.  ND. +BS.   EXTREMITIES: WWP, no c/c/e, 2+ peripheral pulses.   SKIN: No rashes or lesions.   LYMPH: No cervical LAD.   NEURO: Awake, A&Ox3, CNs II-XII grossly intact.',
    'active', 'system_generator'
);


