VALUES (
    '29175678', '10965345', 'acute appendicitis', 'APPENDICITIS',
    'A patient was admitted via ew emer. for evaluation of abdominal symptoms, later diagnosed with acute appendicitis.', 'Mr. ___ is a ___ old male who presents to his PCP today with symptoms of RLQ pain and melena. Of note, he was recently seen in the ED with hematemesis in the setting of ETOH on ___ and had a negative NGT lavage and was sent home. He was starting to feel better until ___ evening when he developed sudden onset of sharp RLQ pain comming in waves, no radiation as well as 3 episodes of loose black tarry stools and rigors. He does use NSAIDs for pain control occassionally.   Of note his last colonoscopy was in ___ and it showed colonic polyps. He is due for his next colonoscopy ___ years from that colonoscopy. He never had an EGD.', 'carcinoma in situ of rectum, high blood sugars, HTN, HA, suicide  attempt, polysubstance abuse   Social History: ___ Family History: father died of MI at ___, brother with CABG at age ___, mother  died of brain aneurysm.', '[VITALS] Temp: NA BP: NA HR: 100 O2Sat: NA Weight: NA  [EXAM] Afebrile, vital signs stable Gen: AAOx3, NAD Card: RRR Pulm: CTA Abd: obese abdomen, tender to deep palpation RLQ, no  rebound/guarding Ext: no edema Wound: port incisions c/d/i',
    'active', 'system_generator'
);


