VALUES (
    '29775414', '10986405', 'Acute appendicitis', 'APPENDICITIS',
    'A patient was admitted via ew emer. for evaluation of abdominal symptoms, later diagnosed with acute appendicitis.', 'The patient is a ___ year old female with a history of ovarian  cysts and endometriosis who presented initially with a 36-hour  history of suprapubic/RLQ pain. She reports onset of sharp pain  in the suprapubic region the day prior to admission at approx  2:30am - awaking her from sleep, which she reported as radiating  to the RLQ.  She then proceeded to have multiple episodes of  nonbloody, nonbilious emesis.  The patient otherwise denied  associated fevers/chills, constipation/diarrhea, urinary  frequency, or dysuria. She initially attributed her symptoms to  a ruptured ovarian cyst, as she reports a history of similar  pain and emesis with prior cyst rupture. However, she finally  decided to present to the emergency department when the symptoms  failed to resolve.   The patient reports her last menstruation to have occurred on  ___. She has irregular menses in at baseline, and reports  that this most recent menstruation was not atypical.', 'Past medical history: Endometriosis; ovarian cysts;  nephrolithiasis ___ years ago); car accident in ___  Past surgical history: D&C  Medications at home: Percocet 5mg PRN (since the car accident)   Obstetric history: G1P0    Social History: ___ Family History: Non-contributory', '[VITALS] Temp: NA BP: NA HR: NA O2Sat: NA Weight: NA  [EXAM] GENERAL: Patient appears her stated age, in no acute distress;  alert and fully oriented; pleasant and cooperative on exam HEENT: Mucous membranes moist and pink; no scleral icterus; no  ocular or nasal',
    'active', 'system_generator'
);


