VALUES (
    '22626029', '11407165', 'Acute appendicitis', 'APPENDICITIS',
    'A patient was admitted via ew emer. for evaluation of abdominal symptoms, later diagnosed with acute appendicitis.', '___ is a ___ year old male with a two day history of RLQ  abdominal pain. The pain is described as sharp and  non-radiating.  The pain is dull when he is lying still. He has  had some diarrhea, as well as some nausea, but no emesis.  He  reports that he felt febrile today, and has had some sweats. He  continues to have flatus.  He reports having a decreased  appetite. His last po intake was at 11am this morning, but he  reports feeling hungry currently. He does not think that if he  was given food that he would actually be able to tolerate intake  though.  ROS: Positive for the above mentioned symptoms; otherwise  negative on a full review of systems, including headaches,  vision changes, nasal congesion, difficulty swallowing,  palpitations, chest pain, wheezing, shortness of breath,  vomiting, melena, bright red blood per rectum, dysuria, urinary  frequency, rashes, bleeding, bruising, chills and unintentional  weight loss.', 'No history of any medical problems. Prior surgeries include a  patellar tendon surgery, as well as I&D of an infected abdominal  stab wound.   Social History: ___ Family History: Grandfather - gastric cancer Grandmother - lung cancer Uncle - throat cancer', '[VITALS] Temp: 98.7 BP: 152/82 HR: 94 O2Sat: 98 Weight: NA  [EXAM] Physical exam on admission:  VS: T 98.7, HR 94, BP 152/82, RR 18, O2 sat 100% RA Gen: no acute distress, alert, responsive Pulm: unlabored breathing CV: regular rate and rhythm Abd: soft, nondistended, tender in the RLQ, mild rebound, no  guarding Ext: warm and well perfused  Physical exam',
    'active', 'system_generator'
);


