VALUES (
    '21627696', '11552008', 'perforated appendicitis', 'APPENDICITIS',
    'A patient was admitted via ew emer. for evaluation of abdominal symptoms, later diagnosed with acute appendicitis.', '___ presents with generalized abdominal pain that began 5 days  ago.  Over the past 2 days it has localized to her right lower  quadrant.  She was seen by her PCP on ___ who thought her symptoms were due to constipation and started her on a bowel  regimen.  The pain persisted.  Today she was evaluated by her  PCP and and ___.  She was noted to have yellow discharge  from her cervix and right adnexal tenderness.  An U/S showed normal  ovaries but did show a dilated tubular structure with debris and  fluid within in as well as a potential appendicolith.  She did  have diarrhea today, nonbloody.  She ate toast this morning and  is hungry.  No fevers, nausea, emesis, or dysuria.  (+) chills.  No similar episodes prior to this one.', 'PMH: asthma, gestational diabetes, herpes simplex, atrial septal  defect   PSH: C-section   Social History: ___ Family History: non-contributory', '[VITALS] Temp: NA BP: 110/72 HR: NA O2Sat: 98 Weight: NA  [EXAM] 98.0, 70, 110/72, 16, 100% on room air Gen: no distress, alert and oriented x 3 HEENT: PERLA, EOMI, anicteric, mucus membranes moist Chest: RRR, lungs clear bilaterally Abd: soft, nondistended, nontender Rectal: Bimanual: right adnexal tenderness, yellow',
    'active', 'system_generator'
);


