VALUES (
    '20515944', '11614115', 'Acute appendicitis', 'APPENDICITIS',
    'A patient was admitted via eu observation for evaluation of abdominal symptoms, later diagnosed with acute appendicitis.', 'pt is a ___ year old male with a recent history of prostate  cancer diagnosed on ___, but was never treated per pt prefrence. presenting of 48 hours of abdominal pain, and constipation. Pt reports abdominal pain starting yesterday morning. It started diffusely in the abdomen and epigastric area and now is focused in the RLQ. Pain is associated with nausea, but no vomitting. Pt has been using laxatives and other supplements for his cancer Dx (alkalinizing supplements - has stopped). Denies fever, cough, vomiting, bloody stool, dysuria). CT scan in the ED showed acute uncomplicated diverticulitis, VSS, WBC 13.5. On exam  his  abdomen is soft , non distended, TTP in RLQ, no rebound or guarding. Denies chest pain, SOB, Palpitation, fevers, or chils. Pt stated that he is going to started radio therapy in the next ___ weeks.', 'PMH: Prostate cancer  PSH: R ankle surgery, R inguinal hernia repair    Social History: ___ Family History: non contributory', '[VITALS] Temp: NA BP: NA HR: 120 O2Sat: NA Weight: NA  [EXAM] VS: stable  General: A/O X3, in no acute distress,  HEENT: EOMI, NCAT, anicteric Cardio: RRR, no M/R/G Pulm: clear sounds bilateral, Abdomen: Soft, non distended, minimaly tender,  no rebound or  guardingm incisions c/d/I, Neuro: grossly intact',
    'active', 'system_generator'
);


