VALUES (
    '23553042', '11693488', 'Acute appendicitis', 'APPENDICITIS',
    'A patient was admitted via eu observation for evaluation of abdominal symptoms, later diagnosed with acute appendicitis.', 'Ms. ___ is a ___ with PMH constipation, GERD, gastritis who presents with 1 day of abdominal pain. She has long-standing constipation and first noted no BMs over the past couple of  days, which did not particularly alarm her. She then developed intermittent sharp periumbilical abdominal pain yesterday. She was able to tolerate a light dinner, but her pain became more severe overnight. She had one episode of NBNB emesis at home and had several more here in the ED. Symptoms have been associated with chills at home. She tried an antispasmodic medication she brought from ___ and this did not help her pain.  Of note, she reports having had similar symptoms once before about ___ years ago. At that time she had an EGD here and was found to have gastritis and GERD. She has no personal or family history of IBD or GI cancers. She has never had a colonoscopy.  ROS: (+) per HPI (-) Denies jaundice, rashes, bleeding, easy bruising, headache, dizziness, vertigo, syncope, weakness, paresthesias, hematemesis, bloating, cramping, melena, dysphagia, chest pain, shortness of breath, cough, edema, urinary frequency, urgency', 'Constipation, gastritis, GERD   Social History: ___ Family History: Non-contributory', '[VITALS] Temp: NA BP: NA HR: NA O2Sat: NA Weight: NA  [EXAM] Gen: NAD, AxOx3 Card: HDS Pulm: no respiratory distress Abd: Soft, appropriately tender, non-distended   Wounds: c/d/i Ext: No edema, warm well-perfused',
    'active', 'system_generator'
);


