VALUES (
    '21085648', '11719981', 'gallstone pancreatitis and chronic cholecystitis', 'CHOLECYSTITIS',
    'A patient was admitted via ew emer. for evaluation of abdominal symptoms, later diagnosed with acute gallbladder disease.', 'Ms ___ is a ___ year old woman who presents as a tranfer from an OSH with complaints of 3 days of RUQ pain and nausea without vomiting and an ultrasound showing gallstones. She states that she was awoken from sleep at 2AM 3 days ago with severe epigastric and RUQ pain that was worse with movement. The pain was intermittent was but did not get better.  She had low grade fevers 100.0, no diarrhea, last BM yesterday, no blood.  Never had symptoms like this before, although she was aware she had gallstones.  Never had symptoms of biliary cholic.', 's/p appendectomy,  TAH,  total thyroidectomy (thyroid CA)   Social History: ___ Family History: positive for gallstones', '[VITALS] Temp: 98.5 BP: 121/78 HR: 76 O2Sat: 98 Weight: NA  [EXAM] Vitals T: 98.5 BP: 121/78 HR: 76 RR: 18 02 sat:  98%/RA GENERAL: Pleasant, well appearing woman in NAD HEENT: Normocephalic, atraumatic. No conjunctival pallor. No  scleral icterus. PERRLA/EOMI. Neck Supple, No thyromegaly.   CARDIAC: Regular rhythm, normal rate. Normal S1, S2. No murmurs,   LUNGS: CTA  bilaterally ABDOMEN: NABS. Soft, NT, ND.',
    'active', 'system_generator'
);


