VALUES (
    '28066809', '11875279', 'acute cholecystitis', 'CHOLECYSTITIS',
    'A patient was admitted via ew emer. for evaluation of abdominal symptoms, later diagnosed with acute gallbladder disease.', 'HISTORY OF PRESENTING ILLNESS   This patient is a ___ year old female who complains of upper  abdominal pain. Has been taking omeprazol for 8 weeks for  presumed gastritis; stopped to days ago. Yesterday the  patient then developed epigastric pain even more severe then she was used to, yesterday with radiation to left shoulder.  Today the pain has not been radiating. The patient has had  nausea/vomiting and chills, no fevers.                        Timing: Sudden Onset                       Quality: Dull                      Severity: Severe                      Duration: 2 Days                      Location: epigastric     Associated Signs/Symptoms: vomiting', 'Past Medical History: None    Social History: ___ Family History: NC', '[VITALS] Temp: 97.4 BP: 131/90 HR: 112 O2Sat: 97 Weight: NA  [EXAM] Physical examination upon admission:  ___    Temp:97.4 HR:112 BP:131/90 Resp:16 O(2)Sat:100 normal    Constitutional: Uncomfortable Chest: Clear to auscultation Cardiovascular: Regular Rate and Rhythm, Normal first and  second heart sounds Abdominal: Soft, ttp RUQ ___, no rebound tenderness.,  Nondistended GU/Flank: No costovertebral angle tenderness Extr/Back: No cyanosis, clubbing or edema Skin: No rash, Warm and dry Neuro: Speech fluent Psych: Normal mood, Normal mentation',
    'active', 'system_generator'
);


