    '21808474', '11876479', 'appendicitis', 'APPENDICITIS',
    'A patient was admitted via ew emer. for evaluation of abdominal symptoms, later diagnosed with acute appendicitis.', '___ yo F s/p RnYGBP in ___ presents with one day of  periumbilical/epigastric abdominal pain which has migrated to  the RLQ. This pain was band-like across her abdomen and she  describes it as a burning sensation. Not associated with eating.  Last BM this AM at 8. She was awoken by the pain at 5:00 AM. She  denies n/v/f/c/cp/sob, but the pain has been so severe that she decided  to come in. Denies BRBPR, melena, changes in urinary habits.', '1. Sleep apnea 2. C-section ___ years prior 3. Kidney stone @ ___ years old   4. BTL ___ years ago 5. L sided back pain x ___ years following epidural    Social History: ___ Family History: FH: Father with kidney cancer s/p resection ___ yr. ago; Mother  deceased MI ___, also DM.', '[VITALS] Temp: NA BP: 118/68 HR: NA O2Sat: 98 Weight: NA  [EXAM] 98.0 80  118/68  20  100%RA GEN: A&O, NAD   HEENT: No scleral icterus, mucus membranes moist   CV: RRR, No M/G/R   PULM: Clear to auscultation b/l, No W/R/R   ABD: Soft, nondistended, TTP in RUQ and RLQ, voluntary guarding, normoactive bowel sounds, no palpable masses    Ext: No ___ edema, ___ warm and well perfused',
