VALUES (
    '29349685', '11936168', 'Acute appendicitis', 'APPENDICITIS',
    'A patient was admitted via ew emer. for evaluation of abdominal symptoms, later diagnosed with acute appendicitis.', '___ Pulmonary fellow here at ___, h/o exercise-induced asthma p/w persistent RLQ/suprapubic pain and increased urinary frequency x2days.  Pain is dull and non-radiating.  Pt endorses anorexia w/ associated nausea but denies F, C, SOB, CP, emesis, changes in bowel function', 'Past Medical History: childhood asthma, now w/ exercise-induced asthma, spontaneous L PTX s/p dart w/ Heimlich valve x3days  Past Surgical History: L shoulder arthroscopic repair of labrum    Social History: ___ Family History: non contributory', '[VITALS] Temp: 98.8 BP: 131/90 HR: 95 O2Sat: 98 Weight: NA  [EXAM] Temp 98.8    HR 95   BP 131/90    RR 18    O2 sat 100% RA GEN: A&O, NAD HEENT: No scleral icterus, mucus membranes moist CV: RRR, No M/G/R PULM: Clear to auscultation b/l, No W/R/R ABD: diminished bowel sounds, soft, nondistended, +TTP RLQ/groin w/ + focal rebound, +Rovsing, no palpable masses Ext: No ___ edema, ___ warm and well perfused',
    'active', 'system_generator'
