VALUES (
    '28048474', '11998037', 'acute cholecystitis pancreatic adenocarcinoma', 'CHOLECYSTITIS',
    'A patient was admitted via direct emer. for evaluation of abdominal symptoms, later diagnosed with acute gallbladder disease.', '___ year old male with a history of a borderline resectable pancreatic adenocarcinoma s/p two cycles of neoadjuvant chemotherapy with Folfirinox with plans to do cyberknife and  then surgical resection. Patient has had episodes of recurrent pancreatitis requiring ERCP stent revision and he is now s/p change out of his plastic biliary stent for a metal covered  stent on ___. Patient now presented to the ___ clinic with worsening RUQ pain for the past 4 days, that has been getting worse during the past 2 days. This has been associated with fevers up to 104 and chills. Denies any nausea or vomiting. Has been passing flatus, but constipated for the past 5 days. Has been eating well and stable on his weight for the past few weeks (182 lb at baseline - 163 lb lately).', '-Pancreatic Ca, started chemotherapy on ___ with one  cycle of FOLFOX after undergoing a change out of his plastic  biliary stent for metal stent on ___. He has subsequently  been started on cycle 1 of FOLFIRINOX. OF note, after folfox, pt  was on neupogen and WBC increased to 20K.   - HTN   - Spermatocele, s/p removal ___   - pancreatitis s/p pancreatitic aspirate    Social History: ___ Family History: Mother had breast cancer; denies h/o pancreatic cancer, skin  cancer, ovarian cancer', '[VITALS] Temp: NA BP: NA HR: 120 O2Sat: NA Weight: NA  [EXAM] Gen: NAD CV: RRR Resp: CTA Abd: s/ND/NT, with drain present Ext: no edema',
    'active', 'system_generator'
);


