VALUES (
    '24911607', '12017101', 'Acute appendicitis', 'APPENDICITIS',
    'A patient was admitted via ew emer. for evaluation of abdominal symptoms, later diagnosed with acute appendicitis.', 'Ms. ___ is a ___ yo ___ woman who presents with  RLQ abdominal pain and malaise that began yesterday without  clear precipitant. She states that the pain is somewhat diffuse  but locally worse in the RLQ. She denies fever, but states that  she has alternatively broken out in sweats and experienced  chills since the onset of her pain. She also endorses anorexia,  nausea with no vomiting, and has not taken POs other than a few  strands of spaghetti since her pain began.  She denies  constipation, diarrhea, bloody or tarry stools, hematuria, and  radiation of her pain to her shoulder/neck/back.', 'Past Medical History: - GERD - hemorrhoids - depression - HTN - hypertriglyceridemia - glaucoma - sciatica - colon polyps - vertigo  Past Surgical History: 1. Hysterectomy, ___ years ago without complication   Social History: ___ Family History: Positive for colon cancer in her father. Per ___, diabetes,  hypercholesterolemia, and heart disease.  One brother died of  metastatic cancer in ___ (origin unknown).', '[VITALS] Temp: NA BP: 146/89 HR: NA O2Sat: 99 Weight: NA  [EXAM] On admission:  Vitals: 99.1 102 146/89 20 100% GEN: A&O, NAD HEENT: No scleral icterus, mucus membranes moist CV: RRR, No M/G/R PULM: Clear to auscultation b/l, No W/R/R ABD: Soft, nondistended. Tender to superficial palpation in the RLQ, with guarding. Rebound could not be appreciated.  Normoactive bowel sounds, no palpable masses. Ext: No ___ edema, ___ warm and well perfused',
    'active', 'system_generator'
);


INSERT INTO clinicalcases (
