VALUES (
    '26137090',
    50920,
    'Using this patient''s age, gender, and serum creatinine value of 0.8, .  estimated GFR (eGFR) is likely >75 mL/min/1.73 m2, .  provided the serum creatinine value is stable. .  (Patients with more muscle mass and better nutritional status are more .  likely to be at the higher end of this range.) .  An eGFR < 60 suggests kidney disease in those below the age of 65 .  and there may be kidney disease in those over 65..',
    '',
    ''
