d.  BONES: There is no evidence of worrisome osseous lesions or acute fracture.  An osseous hemangioma in T8 is unchanged from prior.  SOFT TISSUES: The abdominal and pelvic wall is within normal limits.'
);


INSERT INTO radiologyreport (
